 he bustling port.\nYet there are places that even the ever-present wind ca
 nnot reach\, or rather\, it chooses not to.\nShould one choose to follow a
  secluded path to the tranquil mountain sanatorium\, what might await — 
 peaceful rest\, or an adventure beyond mortal imagination?\n\n
END:VEVENT
